# Disable ALL of git's text/newline conversion for this repo.
#
# The launcher verifies files by SHA-256. If git rewrote LF to CRLF on
# checkout, the same commit would produce different bytes on different
# machines and every file would look modified to some players and not
# others. Treat everything as binary and hand the bytes through unchanged.
#
# Do not "fix" this by adding text rules.
* -text
